      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ɣɔ̱n I-yob in rɛwdɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ mi dɔ̱ŋ cu gaat Kuɔth rɔ̱ nyɔk kɛ ben nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, cu Gua̱n jiäkni ben bä bëë nhiam Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Gua̱n jiäkni thiec i̱, “Kä bi̱i̱ nikä?” Kä cu Gua̱n jiäkni jɛ loc i̱, “Ba̱a̱ jäl rɛy ɣɔaa, wiɛlä rɔ thi̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial jɛ jiök i̱, “Ji̱n ŋäci ja̱ŋdä ni I-yob, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ ram mi päär kɛ jɛ rɛy ɣɔaa? Thilɛ jɛ bɛ̈ɛ̈l kä ɛ Gua̱n cuŋni mi luth Kuoth kä lo̱k jiäk. Jɛn ŋotdɛ thiɛkädɛ, cäŋɛ ni mɔ ci ɣä jak kä da̱kä jɛ mɔ ni baaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Kuoth Nhial loc i̱, “La raan ti diaal päl kɛ ɣöö bɛ tëk! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Met ni jɛ lät kä duɔ̱ɔ̱r puɔ̱ɔ̱nydɛ, mi /cɛ ji̱ bi kuëth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial jɛ jiök i̱, “Jɛn ɔ cä la̱th tetkädu mɔ, duundɛ ɣöö /cu jɛ näk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Gua̱n jiäkni jiɛɛn nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, kä cuɛ I-yob wä moc kɛ juey gupä a känɛ jɛ pa̱a̱tni ciöknikɛ cu mäni wi̱cdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu I-yob rɔ moc kɛ tha̱lier",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "tha̱lier",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ thok ji̱käny dɔaar cɔalkɛ jɛ i̱ pa̱lier.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mi la jɔnyɛ puɔ̱nydɛ, kä cuɛ wä ciɛŋ ni rɛy ŋɛthä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ciekdɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Ji̱n ŋotdi ni thiɛkädu? Ɛŋu ci Kuoth kueth ɔ bi cu li̱w!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ciekdɛ loc i̱, “Ji̱n ruaci nikɛ ruac ciek mi dɔ̱a̱r. A banɛ ku nhɔk ni gɔy kä Kuoth Nhial kärɔ̱, kä /canɛ jiäk bi nhɔk?” Kɛ kui̱ kä ti̱ti̱ diaal /ken I-yob duer la̱t kɛ tin latdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cuɔ̱p mäthni I-yob da̱ŋ diɔ̱k",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci mäthni I-yob da̱ŋ diɔ̱k jiäk diaal tëë ci tuɔɔk kä jɛ liŋ, cu kɛ ben gua̱thnikiɛn tin cieŋkɛ thi̱n, Ɛ-li-padh raan Te-man kɛ Bil-dad raan Cuwa kɛ Dho-par raan Naamaa. Cu kɛn ɛ mat ɛn ɣöö bikɛ ben kä I-yob ba ben luäk kɛ pa̱r kä ba ben bum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cikɛ jɛ nɛn a na̱n, /ken kɛ jɛ ŋic. Kä cukɛ wiee kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t. Kä cukɛ bieyni kiɛn rɛ̈t, kä cukɛ ŋɛ̈th kiɛth nhial wuɔ̱thnikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ nyuur piny kɛɛl kɛ jɛ kɛ ni̱n bärɔw. Kä cuɛ thil ram mi cu ruac kɛ jɛ, kɛ ɣöö cikɛ cuɔ̱cdɛ nɛn di̱tdɛ ɛlɔ̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
